<!--
  aichauffeur.ai — sitemap                              AIC SITE RUN 1 · TASK D

  ONLY aichauffeur.ai URLs appear here. The aivoiceagency.ai sitemap contains
  zero /chauffeur/ URLs (verified this run), so the two hosts never cross-index.

  Served at https://aichauffeur.ai/sitemap.xml because the `aichauffeur` Vercel
  project is rooted at /chauffeur/. Real file, not a rewrite — the repo-root
  vercel.json is not read by that project. This path returned 404 before RUN 1.

  /demo/ is listed here and its noindex was removed this run. A URL submitted in
  a sitemap while carrying noindex is reported by Search Console as an error
  ("Submitted URL marked noindex") — the two settings had to agree.

  AIC RUN 14 · 2026-08-20 — every lastmod on this file is 2026-08-20 and that is
  a fact rather than a habit. The run changed assets/aic.css, which ALL EIGHTEEN
  pages load: the button label size on phones, the tracking on every uppercase
  label, the leading on every button box, the calculator's empty-state colour and
  the measure on .calc-basis. Those are rendering changes on every URL below, not
  a stylesheet tidy nobody sees.

  Four pages changed in their own markup on top of that: / and /demo/ (the
  two-door CTA), /reserve/ (the panel, the disclosure row and the demo block) and
  /rates/ (the table). /book/ changed one rule in its own <style>.

  If a future run touches only one page, only that page's lastmod moves. A file
  where every date is always today is a file a crawler learns to ignore.
-->
